<title>USA: IPO PRICING - New Holland NV at $21.50.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - New Holland NV at $21.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	   New Holland NV</p>
<p>   Priced At			  $21.50</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	$20-23</p>
<p>   Number of Shares	 53.5 million</p>
<p>   Lead underwriter	Goldman Sachs</p>
<p>NOTE: The company makes agricultural tractors and other earth-moving equipment and is owned by Italian carmaker Fiat SpA .</p>
<p>In 1995, 1995, New Holland had net sales and revenues of $5.0 billion and net income of $258.5 million.</p>
